        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-03T10:53:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Flexibility and generality are explicitly non-goals for this API. We want this to be as narrow as possible because the potential for abuse is very concerning.\n\nThe ability to fallback or not to the default network is kind of up in the air. I suspect we will have requests for it and the API should be extensible to support that use case, so I favor having an enum-style int like for OemPreferences.\n\nImmediately, fallback is the only behavior that makes sense because the slice can only be available on 5G whose coverage is spotty at the moment, so no fallback means most of the time the apps in the work profile would get no networking.\n\nI\u0027ll consult again with my API sponsor.",
      "parentUuid": "43e80cec_3868edbf",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9050,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 9050,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "0cfe03c02b4a01dd648684ab38b396d684f8bac3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
